;;
;; Proof receipt of epistemic-types (PROOF-POLICY §8.5.1, profile
;; proof-receipt). It describes source commit bfcee6e and Proof Safety run
;; 42743187886 on that commit: the core job (Agda 2.6.4.3, Debian agda-bin
;; 2.6.4.3-1+b2) and the canonical Echo job. Every :pwg is the value the reader
;; derives from the legs and receipts (standards deed_lint.js
;; --proof-receipt-json). Rows, statements and scope are in PROOF-STATUS.adoc,
;; "Local proof ledger".
;;
;; Every claim is PWG-3: no Rocq or Lean leg exists. C-3 and C-4 are
;; checked by the echo job, the other rows by the core job. C-1 (rejection
;; fixtures) and C-2 (labelled TESTED) are not theorems at PROVEN and are not
;; claims here.
;;
;; The Agda input set is the union of both jobs' cones (§8.5.1: one set per
;; commit and prover), so every claim carries the same manifest and imports.
;; Core job: agda --dependency-graph over the 31 src modules gives those 31
;; modules and 8 supplied with Agda; --no-libraries, so no library file.
;; Echo job: 155 modules: 8 of this repository, 4 of echo-types at the pin
;; in .github/workflows/agda.yml (listed in the home manifest because it
;; holds that pin), 136 of agda-stdlib and 7 supplied with Agda. The home
;; manifest is 36 files: 31 src modules, the 4 tests/integration modules and
;; the workflow. CI reads the stdlib from Debian agda-stdlib 2.1-4. That
;; package carries no source patch, and its src/ (1109 files) is byte-identical
;; to upstream tag v2.1 = 97bc55e, so the import records that commit.
;;
;; A comment-aware postulate scan of both cones, with the Agda v2.6.4.3
;; builtin sources (agda/agda 714c7d2), finds only the four Agda.Primitive
;; postulates in (trusted-base). --safe refuses any other.
(praxis-deed
  :schema-version "1.0.0"
  :canonical-name "epistemic-types-proof-receipt"
  :beholding-chora #u8"chora:estate/github.com/hyperpolymath"
  :profile proof-receipt
  :repository "hyperpolymath/epistemic-types"
  :source-commit "bfcee6e235dd8802e301ea92fa0d445b1c94b807"
  (trusted-base
    (primitive :prover agda :module "Agda.Primitive" :name "Level" :binding "BUILTIN LEVEL")
    (primitive :prover agda :module "Agda.Primitive" :name "lzero" :binding "BUILTIN LEVELZERO")
    (primitive :prover agda :module "Agda.Primitive" :name "lsuc" :binding "BUILTIN LEVELSUC")
    (primitive :prover agda :module "Agda.Primitive" :name "_⊔_" :binding "BUILTIN LEVELMAX"))
  (claim :id "L-1" :pwg PWG-3 :foundation-diverse #f
    (leg :prover agda :route source :token proven :state AGDA-VERIFIED
      (receipt :run "https://github.com/hyperpolymath/epistemic-types/actions/runs/42743187886"
               :commit "bfcee6e235dd8802e301ea92fa0d445b1c94b807"
               :checker "agda 2.6.4.3"
               :invocation "job core (tests/check-proofs.sh): agda --no-libraries --safe --without-K --cubical-compatible --exact-split --no-sized-types --no-guardedness --double-check --ignore-interfaces -i src -W error -W noUnsupportedIndexedMatch M, for each of the 31 modules M under src/EpistemicTypes; job echo (scripts/check-canonical.sh): agda --no-libraries --safe --without-K --cubical-compatible --double-check --ignore-interfaces -W error -W noUnsupportedIndexedMatch -i src -i tests/integration -i ECHO/proofs/agda -i STDLIB/src tests/integration/RecoveryExamples.agda, ECHO being echo-types at the pin in .github/workflows/agda.yml and STDLIB Debian agda-stdlib 2.1-4"
               :inputs-sha256 "28d1f08150ddb4588ce1d43879fa07c285be1490cf1b3f196451cd42f6948f11"
               :state current
